{title: Aa Jao Meri Tamannah}
{artist: Javed Ali Pritam}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
Thoda [F]thehar, thoda [Dm]tehar,        sun le [F]jara,sun le [Dm]jara
dil keh [F]raha, dil keh [Dm]raha,        de na [F]saja,yun [Dm]bewaja
[A#]rooth kar mujhse na [C]ja abhi,        [A#]bhulkar shikwa [C]gila sabhi pyar [Dm]ka
[Dm]aa jaaa [C]oo meri [Dm]tamanna,        [Dm]baaa [C]ho mein [Dm]aao
[Dm]ke ho [C]na paye [Dm]juda,        [Dm]hum aise [C]mujhme [Dm]samao
[Dm]ho har ghadi lag rahi teri [C]kami,        [Dm]le chali kis gali yeh [C]zindagi
[Dm]hai pata lapata hoon pyaar [C]mein,        [Dm]ankahi ansuni chahat [C]jagi
[A#]jo hua pehle [C]hua nahi,        [Dm]aa jaaa [C]oo meri [Dm]tamanna
[Dm]baaa [C]ho mein [Dm]aao,        [Dm]ke ho [C]na paye [Dm]juda
[Dm]hum aise [C]mujhme [Dm]samao,        [Dm]ho rut jawan dil jawan hasrat [C]jawan
[Dm]tu hai to yei bhi hai sare [C]jawan,        [Dm]wo nagar wo dagar hogi [C]haseen
[Dm]tu mile pyaar se mujhko [C]jahan,        [A#]pana hai tujhko [C]yeh dil kahe
[A#]har ghadi ab to [C]nasha rahe pyaar [F]ka,        [Dm]aa jaaa [C]oo meri [Dm]tamanna
[Dm]baaa [C]ho mein [Dm]aao,        [Dm]ke ho [C]na paye [Dm]juda
[Dm]hum aise [C]mujhme [Dm]samao
